**Allahabad Bank** (1865) was the oldest joint-stock bank still working until it merged into **Indian Bank** (2020). **Awadh Commercial Bank** (Faizabad, 1881) was the **first bank fully run by Indians**; **PNB** (Lahore, 1894) was the first with only Indian capital.

